  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM response in Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Flash Appeal for Ukraine. Support to IOM under the UN humanitarian appeal to support the around 6.7 million IDPs within Ukraine. The overall unpredictability of the situation requires humanitarian actors to respond to the needs of the most vulnerable displaced and other conflict-affected communities &#x2013; and particularly female-headed households, children, persons with disabilities and/or chronic illnesses, as well as the elderly.</narrative>
  </description>
